 * LAST MODIFIED: 8/18/2026 4:13:00 am
 *
 * DESCRIPTION:
 * TestPHP8-only installer that makes LP and RD use the same canonical
 * race schedule source:
 *
 *   /race_results/_race_results_schedule.json
 *
 * The canonical file is generated by race_results_monitor.php and contains
 * ESPN-derived MRL points-race identity and race start timing.
 *
 * THIS INSTALLER:
 * - Updates race_results/race_schedule_helper.php v002 -> v003.
 * - Updates team.php v017 -> v018 so RD deadlines use the shared helper.
 * - Updates race_results/race_results_rd_helper.php v003 -> v004 so RD
 *   effective-race selection also uses the shared canonical schedule helper.
 * - Removes LP/RD dependence on race_results/<year>/_schedule.json.
 * - Keeps segment_race_ranges as the DB source for segment boundaries.
 * - Makes no database schema or data changes.
 * - Creates timestamped backups before replacing any file.
